## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.6 Plus
- **Short description:** Alibaba's Plus-tier multimodal Qwen model (released 2026-04-02). 1M context (991K input / 65,536 output), strong image/video + text; coding/agentic improvements over 3.5.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope) across multiple regions. OpenAI/Anthropic compatible. Text, image, video input; text out.
- **Release / knowledge:** GA snapshot 2026-04-02 (knowledge cutoff not published in sampled docs).
- **IDs:** `qwen3.6-plus`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (991,808 input / 65,536 output). Verified via Alibaba docs.
- **Pricing:** International $0.50/$3.00 (≤256 K), $2.00/$6.00 (>256 K); China $0.276/$1.651 (≤256 K), $1.101/$6.602 (>256 K).

